From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: restore factory 3A parameters and simplify control state

Regenerate sensor AE targets from Chromatix and restore the verified LG
contrast AF stop and scene-change conditions. Remove duplicate tuning
helpers, unused generic AF constants, extra AE holds and AF cooldowns.
Wait for AE convergence before starting an automatic focus scan, and avoid
resubmitting unchanged sensor controls. Report lens and OIS control failures
and complete deferred pauses when a lens move fails.

